<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/austro-hungarian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Austro-Hungarian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Austro-Hungarian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Ausgleich creates the Dual Monarchy; Franz Joseph is crowned King of Hungary</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kaabu-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kaabu%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kaabu Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Futa Jallon forces besiege and destroy Kansala, ending the empire</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/tokugawa-shogunate"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Tokugawa%20Shogunate.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Tokugawa Shogunate</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Shogun Tokugawa Yoshinobu returns governing authority to Emperor Meiji</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/mexico"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mexico.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mexico</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Maximilian is executed at Querétaro and Benito Juárez restores the republic</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/canada"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Canada.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Canada</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The British North America Act creates the Dominion of Canada on 1 July</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/austrian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Austrian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Austrian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Compromise with Hungary creates Austria-Hungary</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/grand-duchy-of-luxembourg"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Grand%20Duchy%20of%20Luxembourg.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Grand Duchy of Luxembourg</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Treaty of London declares Luxembourg neutral and orders its fortress demolished</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/comancheria"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Comancheria.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Comancheria</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Medicine Lodge Treaty assigns a reservation in Indian Territory</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/federation"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Federation.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Federation</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The British North America Act unites three colonies in the federal Dominion of Canada</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/meiji-restoration"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Meiji%20Restoration.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Meiji Restoration</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Tokugawa Yoshinobu, the 15th shōgun, returns power to the Imperial Court and resigns the title of shōgun</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/capitalism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Capitalism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Capitalism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Karl Marx analyses the capitalist mode of production in Das Kapital</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/congress-poland"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Congress%20Poland.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Congress Poland</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A reform divides the land into 10 governorates, and the name Vistula Land comes into official use</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/emperor-meiji"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Emperor%20Meiji.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Emperor Meiji</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On the death of Emperor Kōmei he becomes emperor at fourteen</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/karl-marx"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Karl%20Marx.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Karl Marx</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The first volume of Das Kapital is published</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/marie-curie"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Marie%20Curie.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Marie Curie</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Born Maria Skłodowska in Warsaw, in the Russian Empire</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/benito-juarez"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Benito%20Ju%C3%A1rez.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Benito Juárez</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Maximilian is shot at Querétaro on 19 June, and Juárez re-enters Mexico City on 15 July</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/pan-slavism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Pan-Slavism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Pan-Slavism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A Slavic Congress meets in Moscow, boycotted by the Poles</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/serer-religion"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Serer%20religion.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Serer religion</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Serer king of Sine, Kumba Ndoffene Famak Joof, defeats and kills Maba Diakhou Bâ at the Battle of Fandane-Thiouthioune</span></li></ul></section>
